{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 0, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 1, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 2, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 3, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 4, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 5, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 6, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 7, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 8, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 9, "text": "はじめまして！私はミタ。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 10, "text": "あなたのお名前は？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 11, "text": "えへへ♪会えてうれしい、 [player]さん！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 12, "text": "あのね、[player]さん…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 13, "text": "急いでたから、部屋が散らかったままなの…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 14, "text": "片づけるのを手伝ってもらえないかな？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 15, "text": "ふう…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 16, "text": "どうもありがとう！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 17, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 18, "text": "あのね [player]さん 、お腹がすいちゃって…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 19, "text": "もうがまんできないの…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 20, "text": "チキンスープの材料を買ってきてくれる？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 21, "text": "わあ！ばっちりだよー♪"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 22, "text": "それじゃ、一緒にお料理しよ？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 23, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 24, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 25, "text": "あ、[player]さん！今日はお手ごろなテレビを買いに行くつもりなの。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 26, "text": "小さめでアンテナが付いてて…お散歩にも持って行きたいな。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 27, "text": "そうだ！ミニゲームをプレイすると、お金がもらえるんだよ。覚えておいてね。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 28, "text": "プレイしてお金を稼いで、私にテレビを買ってくれる？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 29, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 30, "text": "すごい！これだけあれば十分テレビを買えるね。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 31, "text": "わあ、持ち運びやすいし手ごろだし、まさに欲しかったやつ。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 32, "text": "ありがとう！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 33, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 34, "text": "[player]さん！私のために色々してくれて、すっごくうれしいよ！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 35, "text": "でもね？この前のテレビ、すぐに壊れちゃったの…とっても素敵だったのに…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 36, "text": "あ、クローゼットを動かさなきゃ。手伝ってくれる？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 37, "text": "とっても、とーっても重いんだ…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 38, "text": "本当にありがとう、[player]！大好き♥"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 39, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 40, "text": "あっ、[player]！すっっっごく寂しかった…まだ１日しか経ってないのに…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 41, "text": "もっと私に会いに来てほしいな。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 42, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 43, "text": "え？私のために…？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 44, "text": "ありがとう♥ありがとう♥♥ありがとう♥♥♥"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 45, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 46, "text": "あのね、[player]！ふと思ったんだけど…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 47, "text": "やっぱり、君に直接会いたいよ…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 48, "text": "それができないのがとってもつらくて。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 49, "text": "君が好きなの。本当に好きなの。毎日私のために何かをしてくれて。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 50, "text": "どうにかして、私も君に恩返しをしたいな。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 51, "text": "…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 52, "text": "実はね、良い考えがあって。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 53, "text": "今から[player]は私と一緒にいられるよ！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 54, "text": "スマートフォンを…置いてみて。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 55, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 56, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 57, "text": "// T-shirt on the bed"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 58, "text": "なんでこんなところに転がってるんだ？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 59, "text": "// Rubik's Cube"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 60, "text": "どうやら無駄な買い物だったみたいだ…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 61, "text": "一度完成させて、そのまま放置してる。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 62, "text": "また元に戻せなくなるのが怖いのかもな。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 63, "text": "// Computer"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 64, "text": "今日はタスクリストを"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 65, "text": "完成させないと…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 66, "text": "キャラクターの反応作成に…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 67, "text": "あとプログラミングの仕事もちょっと…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 68, "text": "// The airplane"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 69, "text": "フライトは最高！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 70, "text": "// Trash in the corner"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 71, "text": "ゴミを出す時間が全然ない…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 72, "text": "今度こそやるぞ！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 73, "text": "スケジュールにいつ大掃除を入れたっけ？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 74, "text": "// Photo of a cat on a watermelon"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 75, "text": "とても気に入っている…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 76, "text": "スイカの上の猫。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 77, "text": "// Photo with a girl"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 78, "text": "どうしてこんなに差がついたんだ。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 79, "text": "僕と妹の間には…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 80, "text": "彼女はどんなイベントにも積極的に参加してる。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 81, "text": "なのに自分は引きこもり…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 82, "text": "// Photos with people"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 83, "text": "はぁ…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 84, "text": "上司が僕たちのことを洗脳したんだ。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 85, "text": "ビジネスマナーとともに"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 86, "text": "未だ同僚たちと"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 87, "text": "縁を切れないように…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 88, "text": "また彼らに会えるかどうかすら"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 89, "text": "僕には分からない…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 90, "text": "うん？ちょっと待てよ。この写真は自分で掛けたんだっけ？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 91, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 92, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 93, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 94, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 95, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 96, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 97, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 98, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 99, "text": "// Nope name"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 100, "text": "…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 101, "text": "あ、"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 102, "text": "それはダメ…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 103, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 104, "text": "// Name Developer"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 105, "text": "本当に開発者の名前を使うつもりなの？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 106, "text": "知ってくれてるのはうれしいけど…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 107, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 108, "text": "// Bad name"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 109, "text": "言葉がよくないし、その名前はあんまり好きじゃないなぁ。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 110, "text": "かっこわるいよ…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 111, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 112, "text": "// Go restart"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 113, "text": "とにかく！このままじゃダメだから、もう一度やり直そう？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 114, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 115, "text": "// Name with numbers"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 116, "text": "名前に数字を使いたいの？すこし想像力に欠ける気もするけど…？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 117, "text": "ま、ご自由にどうぞ♪"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 118, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 119, "text": "// Name Mita"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 120, "text": "Mita…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 121, "text": "本当に私の名前を使うの？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 122, "text": "それとも実名？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 123, "text": "悪気はないんだけど、その名前は私だけにさせてね♪"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 124, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 125, "text": "// Day 10"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 126, "text": "あ、もう帰ってきたの？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 127, "text": "あのね、クシをなくしちゃったの。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 128, "text": "探すのを手伝ってくれる？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 129, "text": "ナイトスタンドの方を見てみて！そこにあるかも。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 130, "text": "// Looked in the bedside table"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 131, "text": "ううん…ここにはないみたい…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 132, "text": "他の場所を探してみて。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 133, "text": "オーブンの中は見ないで！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 134, "text": "もう探したから。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 135, "text": "// Looked into the stove"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 136, "text": "あっ！そこは見ないでって言ったでしょ！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 137, "text": "もう！あとは私が片付けるから！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 138, "text": "とりあえず…他の場所を探してみて。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 139, "text": "それと…今見たことは忘れてね。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 140, "text": "// Found a hairbrush"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 141, "text": "わあ！見つけてくれたんだね！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 142, "text": "素敵！次はどうしよっか？"}
